  "system": "Graphon V1. Graphon uses a set of open source models as one part of a much larger closed source system. At ingest, Graphon processes the benchmark's raw emails, images and videos, and a VLM describes images and video frames; the benchmark's released processed-memory fields for images and videos (captions, OCR text, locations and tags) are kept as file metadata. The answer model below writes the answer from Graphon's retrieved context.",
